    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d89">

                <pb facs="0308" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg224"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>No. 85.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Reinberg to Mr. Davis.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-01-13"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 13,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Julio Romano Santos, prisoner at Port Manta. Northern ports continue closed.
                    Government claims Santos is an Ecuadorian, and wants proofs of his American
                    citizenship.</p>
                <closer><signed>REINBERG.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
